      "has_video": false,
      "song_audio": "books/mlr_dec_067/audio/song/p01.mp3",
      "song_duration_ms": 5250
    },
    {
      "page_id": "p02",
      "text": "No one reads a cook book from the start to the end. A cook looks up one thing.",
      "image": "books/mlr_dec_067/pages/p02.webp",
      "audio": "books/mlr_dec_067/audio/pages/p02.mp3",
      "duration_ms": 6608,
      "voice": "57785406027844b29b63a772a8477bc2",
      "has_video": false,
      "song_audio": "books/mlr_dec_067/audio/song/p02.mp3",
      "song_duration_ms": 7810
    },
    {
      "page_id": "p03",
      "text": "A cook book starts with the list. Look: an egg, milk and butter from a cow.",
      "image": "books/mlr_dec_067/pages/p03.webp",
      "audio": "books/mlr_dec_067/audio/pages/p03.mp3",
      "duration_ms": 6922,
      "voice": "57785406027844b29b63a772a8477bc2",
      "has_video": false,
      "song_audio": "books/mlr_dec_067/audio/song/p03.mp3",
      "song_duration_ms": 7758
    },
    {
      "page_id": "p04",
      "text": "Then the steps, in order: a good cook looks at the book, then at the clock.",
      "image": "books/mlr_dec_067/pages/p04.webp",
      "audio": "books/mlr_dec_067/audio/pages/p04.mp3",
      "duration_ms": 6556,
      "voice": "57785406027844b29b63a772a8477bc2",
      "has_video": false,
      "song_audio": "books/mlr_dec_067/audio/song/p04.mp3",
      "song_duration_ms": 7627
    },
    {
      "page_id": "p05",
      "text": "Long ago, cooks stood at a wood fire. No book said how hot the wood was; a cook understood.",
      "image": "books/mlr_dec_067/pages/p05.webp",
      "audio": "books/mlr_dec_067/audio/pages/p05.mp3",
      "duration_ms": 8620,
      "voice": "57785406027844b29b63a772a8477bc2",
      "has_video": false,
      "song_audio": "books/mlr_dec_067/audio/song/p05.mp3",
      "song_duration_ms": 10971
    },
    {
      "page_id": "p06",
      "text": "Wood does not get hot, so a cook book says to grip the wooden handle.",
      "image": "books/mlr_dec_067/pages/p06.webp",
      "audio": "books/mlr_dec_067/audio/pages/p06.mp3",
      "duration_ms": 5668,
      "voice": "57785406027844b29b63a772a8477bc2",
      "has_video": false,
      "song_audio": "books/mlr_dec_067/audio/song/p06.mp3",
      "song_duration_ms": 8097
    },
    {
      "page_id": "p07",
      "text": "A cook book gets filthy, and that is good. Cooking is messy: the best page has egg on it.",
      "image": "books/mlr_dec_067/pages/p07.webp",
      "audio": "books/mlr_dec_067/audio/pages/p07.mp3",
      "duration_ms": 8306,
      "voice": "57785406027844b29b63a772a8477bc2",
      "has_video": false,
      "song_audio": "books/mlr_dec_067/audio/song/p07.mp3",
      "song_duration_ms": 10057
    },
    {
      "page_id": "p08",
      "text": "A cook book must stay open, so it hangs on a hook or a wooden stand.",
      "image": "books/mlr_dec_067/pages/p08.webp",
      "audio": "books/mlr_dec_067/audio/pages/p08.mp3",
      "duration_ms": 5668,
      "voice": "57785406027844b29b63a772a8477bc2",
      "has_video": false,
      "song_audio": "books/mlr_dec_067/audio/song/p08.mp3",
      "song_duration_ms": 7392
    },
    {
      "page_id": "p09",
      "text": "Do not lose Gran's old cook book. No shop has the steps she took.",
      "image": "books/mlr_dec_067/pages/p09.webp",
      "audio": "books/mlr_dec_067/audio/pages/p09.mp3",
      "duration_ms": 5982,
      "voice": "57785406027844b29b63a772a8477bc2",
      "has_video": false,
      "song_audio": "books/mlr_dec_067/audio/song/p09.mp3",
      "song_duration_ms": 5485
    },
    {
      "page_id": "p10",
      "text": "The good pages fall out first. A cook book that looks new is not much good.",
